{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52956","headline":"桃花（题拟） · 元结","name":"桃花（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃源自有长生路，却是秦皇不得知。\n（见《全芳备祖前集》卷八「桃花」门）（按：《淳熙三山志》卷三十六收元结《赠灵石俱胝诗》云：「万计千谋总不真，虚将文字役心神。\n俱胝只念三行咒，自得名超一世人。\n」元结平生未至闽中。\n《淳熙三山志》云：「灵石俱胝院，……唐武宗时僧元修始庵於此，诵七俱胝咒治疾祟。\n」事亦在元结身後。\n疑此诗爲北宋官闽之元绦作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}